AU  - MASUKAWA S
TI  - Projection type display device e.g. projector connected to personal computer, obtains voice guide data corresponding to use condition of each component of device from memory and reproduces obtained voice guide data
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The projection type display device (1) has a memory that stores a preliminarily recorded voice guide data which is associated with a use condition of the device. A control unit detects the present use condition of each component of the device, obtains the voice guide data corresponding to the use condition which exists in the memory and changes the reproducing volume of the voice guide data based on the driving condition of a fan and volume of the ambient noise. A voice reproduction unit reproduces the obtained voice guide data.
                    USE - Projection type display device e.g. projector connected to personal computer using cable conforming to USB, RS232 standards.
                    ADVANTAGE - Since the voice guide data corresponding to the use condition of each component of the device is reproduced, the user is guided to perform appropriate replacement of the abnormal component. Hence the user can easily cope with the abnormal condition.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a schematic view of projection type display device.Projection type display device (1)Personal computer (2)Image signal input terminal (10A)LED indicator (19)Speaker (22)
