TI  - Intensive care unit sickroom mute alarm management            device, has wireless fidelity module for obtaining            serious disease patient vital sign data sent by            external device, and global positioning system module            for obtaining track data of user
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The device has a hand ring main body (1)                detachably provided with a first connecting piece                (2) and a second connecting piece (3). A wireless                charging coil supplies power to an electric device                on the hand ring main body. A touch screen displays                user data, serious disease patient vital sign data                and electric quantity data. An alarm indicator lamp                indicates an emergency condition of seriously ill                patient. A heart rate sensor obtains heart rate                data of the user. A blood pressure sensor obtains                blood pressure data of the user. A blood oxygen                saturation sensor obtains blood oxygen saturation                data of the user. A Wireless fidelity(WiFi) module                and a global positioning system(GPS) module are                respectively connected with a main controller. The                WIFI module is connected with an external device,                and obtains serious disease patient vital sign data                sent by the external device. The GPS module obtains                track data of the user.
                    USE - Intensive care unit sickroom mute alarm                management device.
                    ADVANTAGE - The device is convenient to disassemble and                change the first connecting piece and the second                connecting piece, and has strong stability, and can                realize the personalized monitoring, makes the                patient obtain better rest, ensures the better                sleep environment of the patient, improves the life                quality of patient, and reduces the ICU noise                pollution, which is better for the medical staff to                work for a long time. The device is simple in                structure, and inserts and connects first locating                pin and the first locating pins in the                corresponding locating hole, so that the clamping                block is clamped firmly, provides the physical                state of the user for monitoring through the                temperature sensor, heart rate sensor, blood                pressure sensor and blood oxygen saturation sensor,                and effectively avoids fatigue.
                    DETAILED DESCRIPTION - An INDEPENDENT CLAIM is included for an                intensive care unit sickroom mute alarm management                system.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows an exploded perspective                view of an intensive care unit sickroom mute alarm                management device.1Hand ring main body2First connecting piece3Second connecting piece
