TI  - Device for realizing bird-expelling and            pre-warning of horizontal shaft wind generating set,            has device main body installed on inner side of blade            in wind generating set, and audio generating system for            generating early warning audio
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The device has a bird-expelling pre-warning                device main body installed on an inner side of a                blade in a horizontal shaft wind generating set.                The bird-expelling pre-warning device main body is                provided with a mechanical energy supply system (3)                and an audio generating system (8). The mechanical                energy supply system provides driving force to the                audio generating system. The audio generating                system generates bird-expelling early warning                audio. A protective cover (7) is installed on an                inner side of a blade shell (1) of a wind                generating set. A pendulum (4), a clock work spring                assembly (5) and a wheel assembly (6) are arranged                in the protective cover.
                    USE - Device for realizing bird-expelling and                pre-warning of a horizontal shaft wind generating                set.
                    ADVANTAGE - The device can effectively pre-warn birds,                reduce environment noise pollution and risk of                blade lightning stroke. The device has simple                research and development, low manufacturing cost                and high operation reliability, and can realize                self-energy supply.
                    DETAILED DESCRIPTION - An INDEPENDENT CLAIM is included for a device                for realizing bird-expelling and pre-warning of a                horizontal shaft wind generating set.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a front-sectional view of a                device for realizing bird-expelling and pre-warning                of a horizontal shaft wind generating set.Blade shell (1)Mechanical energy supply system (3)Pendulum (4)Clock work spring assembly (5)Wheel assembly (6)Protective cover (7)Audio generating system (8)
